---
metadata: {
    partial_name: "System | Form result",
}
---
{%- comment -%}
  A confirmation shown after a form is sent. Called with:
    render 'system/form_result', title: 'Success', message: message
  message is HTML written by the caller, never text from the request.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="form-result-wrapper">
    <div class="spacer section"></div>
    <div class="thank-you">
        <div class="grid-x grid-padding-x text-center">
            <div class="large-12 medium-12 small-12 cell">
                <div class="thank-you-img spacer">
                    <i class="icon-number-of-checks"></i>
                </div>
                <h1 class="heading-1">{{ title | escape }}</h1>
                <div class="spacer"></div>
                <div>{% print message %}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="spacer section"></div>
</div>
